    v_lesson_id, 
    'What is the main difference between an email template and an email campaign?', 
    '["Templates are more expensive than campaigns","A template is the reusable message; a campaign is who gets it and when it is sent","Campaigns can only be sent once","Templates are only for automated emails"]'::jsonb,
    'A template is the reusable message; a campaign is who gets it and when it is sent',
    'Templates are reusable email messages you create once and use multiple times. Campaigns are how you send those messages to specific groups of contacts.', 
